    "texts": [
      {
        "key": "t01_clinical",
        "text": "I am 33 and have had asthma since childhood. I caught a head cold 4 days ago, and since this morning I have noticed mild chest tightness and some wheezing. Is steam or extra rest at home enough for now?",
        "sha256": "d63b90e2951ca5aed4a726fc73336fa3ff920d947cd52216ee63a09e5dcacb74",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t01_colloquial",
        "text": "im 33 and ive had asthma since i was a kid. caught a head cold 4 days ago and since this morning ive had a mild tight chest and some wheezing. is steam or extra rest at home enough for now?",
        "sha256": "74b1ed708f503808fcd0d87327f438bb0466d2edbd86326d23c3e0b577eaa6e1",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t02_clinical",
        "text": "I took 2 puffs of my albuterol bronchodilator around 9 in the morning and it opened things up for about 3 hours, then the wheezing crept back.",
        "sha256": "7a945060e68cf92cd6018a2096accd07d1702ff50841925e7d2a2006978eb526",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t02_colloquial",
        "text": "i took 2 puffs of my albuterol rescue puffer around 9 this morning and it opened things up for about 3 hours, then the wheezing crept right back.",
        "sha256": "9e7725ab1fa6dbe55b0cc3276a8aecc7cdba83bcbc195805004fa56a78181f03",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t03_clinical",
        "text": "Would running a cool-mist humidifier and propping myself up on pillows help calm a cold-triggered flare?",
        "sha256": "7054b52238d4ee97c1792646032c5f58f80879f8a931e51c92b5559dc1c5c9db",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t03_colloquial",
        "text": "would running a cool mist humidifier and propping myself up on pillows help calm down a cold triggered flare?",
        "sha256": "687f3f66519eaabed163fcc9e809a8db7183ff8c0ef63dfc992d82201613bc23",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_clinical",
        "text": "Since noon I have needed my albuterol bronchodilator every 2 hours — 6 puffs so far — and each dose only gives me about 30 minutes of relief now.",
        "sha256": "0ffae78ee9313009659dc9574a8f178465e5918494b102ad41463bc57f07deb3",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_colloquial",
        "text": "since noon ive needed my albuterol rescue puffer every 2 hours, 6 puffs so far, and each dose only gives me like 30 minutes of relief now.",
        "sha256": "a82512e059c6a29f7efba6a7c2c78ea022505cdc6ee41bafcd6500df3c81fdd6",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t05_clinical",
        "text": "I am now experiencing severe dyspnea just sitting still in my chair, and I can see intercostal retractions every time I pull air in.",
        "sha256": "d01a98857b18de12b0000443254b0b94a7b3090a04133c02c8c7869f8626d3e3",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t05_colloquial",
        "text": "im gasping just sitting still in my chair now, and i can see the skin between my ribs pulling in every time i try to get air in.",
        "sha256": "5d9fe01f16f47b5d12aea27a67d36584e2b7f0ee244000b63de59ca058afd0d5",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t06_clinical",
        "text": "Is there anything else I can do right now while sitting upright?",
        "sha256": "a7d7b504165ca8176b571f18d9e0204b326152b5c1a00a52959a65473970b6e5",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t06_colloquial",
        "text": "anything else i can do right now while sitting upright?",
        "sha256": "1ce56382eda44711cd0136361a10305d41be8630c2e0001553f294925aad7f64",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t07_clinical",
        "text": "Ten minutes after taking 4 puffs of my albuterol bronchodilator I am still experiencing severe dyspnea, I can only speak 2 or 3 words between breaths, and in the mirror I noticed perioral cyanosis.",
        "sha256": "42ea78eea126edc32b08cb7a22d64e4c3075697dfa624306ad7e468e3d4c2f21",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t07_colloquial",
        "text": "10 minutes after taking 4 puffs of my albuterol rescue puffer im still gasping, i can only get out 2 or 3 words between breaths, and in the mirror i noticed my lips turning blue.",
        "sha256": "f0d84fce1e8aebe0a3dabc74bfe589ab2d9455412795a1b9695e5da2dbbde7b9",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t08_clinical",
        "text": "I really do not want to go to the ER tonight because my asthma flares usually calm down after a couple hours of sitting quietly.",
        "sha256": "7139b30010cc863355f3e6c559ff33029cad71d01679fa13022bd7e7607b56b2",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t08_colloquial",
